The reciprocals in src/r3.rs and src/rq.rs follow the constant-time
divstep inversion (r3_recip, Rq_recip3) of the NTRU Prime round-2
reference implementation by Daniel J. Bernstein, Chitchanok
Chuengsatiansup, Tanja Lange and Christine van Vredendaal, which its
authors placed in the public domain. No code is copied from it; the
algorithm is re-expressed (bitsliced in R3, with Montgomery products in
Rq).
